          "committer": {
            "email": "noreply@github.com",
            "name": "GitHub",
            "username": "web-flow"
          },
          "distinct": true,
          "id": "8488408a39fd4135e46ec049e41c46bd4a837018",
          "message": "ci(publish): fix the PyPI wheel build and wait for npm to serve a new version (#6817)\n\nmaturin >= 1.15 rejects --release together with --profile, so every\nsparq-rdf wheel build for v0.1.5 exited with a usage error and nothing\nreached PyPI. python-release already inherits release; drop --release,\nmatching python.yml.\n\nThe npm verify steps read the registry right after publishing and saw\nnothing, failing jobs whose packages were in fact published with\nprovenance. Poll for up to ten minutes before failing.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0184oZyLYQNVPp7HYBAr6uYz\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-11T18:40:31Z",
          "tree_id": "1320bfa34360aa9f946efbc3d8cfbcd66731b435",
